# Branches in this repo that are entered only by a pull request the owner merges,
# in addition to the driver default (develop main master).
#
# Taskr has three branch roles, which is why this file exists at all: `develop`
# is the 2020 legacy tip, `main` is the cutover target tagged `legacy-final`, and
# `rebuild/v1` is where rebuild work actually merges - so the integration branch
# is NOT one of the three default names and would otherwise fall through as if it
# were a feature branch.
rebuild/v1
